%% CleanSweep sweep pipeline as built (2026-10-26, with differential probes). Source for pipeline.png.
flowchart TD
    T["Target: local Python project<br/>(toy repo, demo app, any path)"] --> O["open_workspace<br/>temp copy + git 'base' commit"]
    O --> A["build_graph + extract_features<br/>AST code graph, reachability, duplicates"]
    A --> D["Reviewer detectors<br/>leftover files, dead code, duplicates, wrappers,<br/>unused imports/deps, security, formatting"]
    D --> J{"LLM judge<br/>CLEANSWEEP_JUDGE_MODE"}
    J -- "gatekeeper: suggest/keep → suggest lane" --> P
    J -- "advisory: reason + confidence only" --> P
    J -- "off" --> P
    P["Over-engineering review<br/>coverage run + test calls in prompt;<br/>report-only findings"] --> R["Ranker<br/>category priors → safe_score"]
    R --> B["make_batches<br/>risk tiers; dynamic items alone"]
    B --> G["apply_with_bisection(Guard.check_batch)"]
    subgraph Guard["Guard: one check per batch"]
        G1["apply edits<br/>(quarantine deleted files)"] --> G2["compile + import smoke test"]
        G2 --> G3["project tests vs. baseline"]
        G3 --> G4["AST equal? (format-only batches)"]
        G3 --> G5["differential probes (other batches):<br/>LLM-written calls on changed functions, callers<br/>and removed copies vs. their replacement;<br/>module still imports, no public name lost"]
        G4 -- pass --> K["keep (checkpoint)"]
        G5 -- same --> K
        G2 -- fail --> X["roll back; one repair try<br/>for single items; split batch in half"]
        G3 -- fail --> X
        G4 -- fail --> X
        G5 -- differ --> X
    end
    G --> G1
    K --> S["SweepReport<br/>results + stats + final diff"]
    X --> S
    S --> H["run_hidden_checks<br/>&lt;target&gt;_hidden tests the Guard never sees"]
    H --> M["summarize + answer-key outcome score"]
    S -. "suggest lane: reported, not applied" .-> M
